975
00:55:04,809 --> 00:55:07,242
Don't you want
something else, or...?

976
00:55:07,244 --> 00:55:09,047
No. I'm all right.

977
00:55:20,191 --> 00:55:23,026
<i>"He pressed
until the egg cracked,</i>

978
00:55:23,028 --> 00:55:26,665
