I'm not scared.

1021
00:57:48,338 --> 00:57:50,939
I just don't see
the point.

1022
00:57:50,941 --> 00:57:54,876
But if it'll make you happy,
I'll do it next week.

1023
00:57:54,878 --> 00:57:58,381
Okay. Great. Thank you,
Angela, for volunteering

1024
00:57:58,383 --> 00:58:02,584
