1593
01:36:15,678 --> 01:36:20,279
About a week ago, I got a call
from a guy named Len Currie.

1594
01:36:20,281 --> 01:36:22,615
Professor Swenson's
editor.

1595
01:36:22,617 --> 01:36:25,819
He said he'd found my manuscript on
