1601
01:36:42,571 --> 01:36:47,207
And, uh, congratulations
on your... on your book.

1602
01:36:47,209 --> 01:36:49,479
Thanks, I guess.

1603
01:36:50,579 --> 01:36:53,215
Now I have to finish it.

1604
01:36:57,719 --> 01:37:03,293
Ted, I imagine there are now some
