1609
01:37:32,254 --> 01:37:34,654
Sorry that I ruined my career.

1610
01:37:34,656 --> 01:37:38,824
I'm sorry that I sacrificed
my extraordinary wife

1611
01:37:38,826 --> 01:37:41,396
